-Sí.

465
00:27:40,867 --> 00:27:42,160
Voy a necesitar la clave.

466
00:27:44,371 --> 00:27:45,288
Dos, dos, cuatro.

467
00:27:46,706 --> 00:27:47,624
A ver.

468
00:27:48,375 --> 00:27:49,417
Dos, dos...

469
00:27:50,251 --> 00:27:51,169
No funciona.

470
00:27:53,588 --> 00:27:54,589
Y es dos, dos, cuatro.

471
00:27:54,672 --> 00:27:55,673
-¿Seguro?
-Sí.

472
